 cases

Add named tests for mandate references, writer provenance, late arrivals,
context body rendering, explicit board/profile selection and refusal messages.

Proof: canonical new clause suite passes (22 cases). Full original450 sweep
completed:403 killed,46 survived,1 ambiguous anchor. Targeted survivor
reruns and anchor repair follow before publication; no source change.
